  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 94d90c210f499d347ad361f403ad09ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sleeper - Musing - Friendly - O1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: DialogueSystem.Runtime::DialogueSystem.DialogueGraph
  nodes:
  - guid: 981ed7f6-4a72-4927-9f2a-050c03f69d02
    kind: 3
    line:
      text: 
      delaySeconds: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  - guid: fa1f34eb-c334-4be1-bf65-f52ddb8cf8d2
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Don't think I ever told you the reason I came to your stall the day I got here.
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: 3b1b1829-b917-4491-9be9-96ba875b8e1c
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: You were basically my first stop, and only because I saw someone walking away from here with a weird, steaming plate of stuff -- and a big smile.
      delaySeconds: 3.8
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: 78cda8f7-dc55-402d-8d9d-35d625b1b983
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I knew what it was, the smile, that is. Yet, it felt alien.
      delaySeconds: 6.2
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: 5fed4a62-7c78-4ad4-a097-62d832900f42
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Like something you read about, but never see in real life. You know, like books.
      delaySeconds: 3.1
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
  - guid: 7f073b95-53d0-45c5-a2f3-99569cc33067
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: And sometimes I think about what would have happened if I don't find your stall that day...
      delaySeconds: 3.9
    editorPosition: {x: 1300, y: 0}
  - guid: 2403794e-5ad0-4bc2-a072-7e0356ebeb70
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Anyways, I did, and I got my fair share of smiles too.
      delaySeconds: 4.2
    editorPosition: {x: 1560, y: 0}
  - guid: 99a60b06-0e00-4263-abd3-8bac5d4bc147
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Your stall has a charm, like no other.
      delaySeconds: 2.9
    editorPosition: {x: 1820, y: 0}
  - guid: 594420f0-1f23-4d8a-9374-04b2d1cefe00
    kind: 4
    line:
      text: 
      delaySeconds: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 2080, y: 0}
